WEBVTT

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:30.756
from accessing the website beyond it.

00:03:31.836 --> 00:03:34.516
We are in the year 2022.

00:03:34.556 --> 00:03:36.636
The first set of guidelines for websites

00:03:36.676 --> 00:03:40.316
to help ensure that they met
the needs of disabled people

00:03:40.316 --> 00:03:45.316
were released quite recently,
actually, in 1999.

00:03:45.316 --> 00:03:48.716
A mere 23 years ago.

00:03:48.756 --> 00:03:50.636
Yep. I'm not joking.

00:03:50.676 --> 00:03:54.836
All the information has been available
to everyone since then.

00:03:54.876 --> 00:03:58.316
It is also a legal requirement
in most countries,

00:03:58.316 --> 00:03:59.716
but above everything else,

00:03:59.756 --> 00:04:02.556
it helps every business
and every organization